# The Gradle wrapper runs on the Linux CI runner. Force LF on the shell script so a
# CRLF shebang can never break it (`bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M`), keep the Windows
# batch wrapper CRLF, and mark the wrapper jar binary so line-ending normalization
# can never corrupt it. Windows contributors otherwise risk all three.
gradlew        text eol=lf
*.sh           text eol=lf
gradlew.bat    text eol=crlf
*.jar          binary
*.keystore     binary
*.jks          binary
